                                "sense_id": "e4516160-0500-3d5a-992d-a84867eb35b6",
                                "text": "The Japenese^([sic]) show this trait also in their daily life; it is their greatest pleasure to attend the exhibitions of professional face distortionists, who to the delight of the public make the oddest faces."
