                                "sense_id": "e4516160-0500-3d5a-992d-a84867eb35b6",
                                "text": "When Hillary tried once more to take Obama’s remarks about Ronald Reagan out of context, making it seem as though Obama had praised Reagan’s policies, he turned sarcastic about getting two distortionists for the price of one."
